WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.402
Your folders show as tabs above the WhatsApp Web chat list

2
00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:06.410
Make a folder: type a name in the WA Folders panel and press Add

3
00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.554
Open a chat, then press Add chat on the folder

4
00:00:08.554 --> 00:00:13.624
Click a tab to see only that folder

5
00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:15.858
Click All to see every chat again

